---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website Terms | Emon Hossain"
  description="Basic website terms for emonhossain.pro. Commercial projects are governed by the specific agreement with the responsible party or entity."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding:4rem 1.5rem;max-width:46rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">TERMS</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:1rem;">Website Terms</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-400);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:.5rem;">Last updated: 24 August 2026</p>

    <div style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.85;margin-top:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
      <p>These terms apply to use of emonhossain.pro as a personal website and information resource. They do not replace a written agreement for a commercial project.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Information on this site</h2>
      <p>Articles, research notes, tool discussions and other materials are provided for general information. AI tools, platform rules, prices and program eligibility can change, so time-sensitive information should be re-verified before acting on it.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Commercial engagements</h2>
      <p>If a project is agreed, the responsible individual or business entity, scope, deliverables, timeline, payment terms, intellectual-property terms, confidentiality requirements, acceptance criteria and other obligations should be stated in the specific written agreement for that work.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">External services</h2>
      <p>This website may link to third-party tools, platforms, businesses or research sources. A link does not by itself mean endorsement, partnership, reseller status or control of the third party.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Content and attribution</h2>
      <p>Original website content may not be represented as someone else's work. Third-party names, trademarks, screenshots, quotations and research remain subject to their respective rights and attribution requirements.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Contact</h2>
      <p>For a question about these website terms, email <a href="mailto:contact@emonhossain.pro" style="color:var(--brand-red);">contact@emonhossain.pro</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
